<title>UK: EIB sets 300 bln lire zero coupon bond due 2000.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 300 bln lire zero coupon bond due 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN ITL   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    10.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS ***</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION VALUE IS LINKED TO THE MIB 30 INDEX</p>
<p>		ISSUE OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>***GENERAL SALES LIMITS WITH SPECIFICATIONS FOR ITALY ONLY. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
